      <h1>Best Cancun Resorts for College Spring Break</h1>
      <p>The best resort for a college group depends on the experience everyone wants. Some students value easy access to entertainment, while others prefer pools, comfortable rooms, and a beach where the group can spend an entire afternoon together.</p>
      <p>Here are three original resort concepts created for this marketing project. These are not real properties or independently verified recommendations.</p>
