      <div class="grid">
        <article class="card">
          <p class="label">Best for social groups</p>
          <h3>Coral Wave Beach Resort</h3>
          <p>Coral Wave is imagined as a lively beachfront property with a large central pool, casual dining, volleyball games, and open gathering areas where friends can plan their day together.</p>
          <h3>Why it stands out</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Group-friendly pool spaces</li>
            <li>Casual food and outdoor seating</li>
            <li>A schedule of daytime social activities</li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>Ideal for:</strong> Groups who want a busy, social atmosphere.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <p class="label">Best for convenience</p>
          <h3>Azure Palm Cancun Club</h3>
          <p>Azure Palm is a fictional modern resort concept focused on convenience. Its imagined features include a comfortable lobby, a poolside cafe, organized excursions, and common spaces for coordinating group plans.</p>
          <h3>Why it stands out</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Easy-to-understand activity schedules</li>
            <li>Shared spaces for friends</li>
            <li>Planned transportation options</li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>Ideal for:</strong> Travelers who want their plans organized in one place.</p>
        </article>

